cRonald_ba488f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Donald McRonald.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> farm, on Farm Lane.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p><b>Donald McRonald</b> is a farmer in <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>. He runs the farm together with his wife <a href=\"#/wiki/Sherry%20McRonald\">Sherry McRonald</a>.<br/>\nHis name is partly taken from the farmer named <b>MacDonald</b> in the nursery rhyme Old MacDonald Had a Farm, and partly from <b>Ronald McDonald</b>, mascot of the large fast-food chain McDonalds.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dead Spider\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dead_Spider_129bda.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Dead Spider</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2 <span class=\"icon\