=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Donald McRonald.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Donald McRonald</strong>: Hmmm, well, hello <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Job</b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: I run a farm, what else?!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>King</b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: King Tibianus is our king.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Name</b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: Donald McRonald.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Time</b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: Who cares?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>City</b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">The city</a> is to the north.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Fields</b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: My fields are enchanted by the <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">druids</a> and the wheat grows very quickly.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Elane\">Elane</a></b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: Too noble to care about us.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Frodo\">Frodo</a></b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: Frodo? He is a friend of mine.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Gorn\">Gorn</a></b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: Hardly know him.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Gregor\">Gregor</a></b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: Knights like you always feel superior to us farmers.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Lynda\">Lynda</a></b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: She has a good soul.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Muriel\">Muriel</a></b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: I dont trust sorcerers.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Oswald\">Oswald</a></b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: He ignores us and we ignore him.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Quentin\">Quentin</a></b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: A generous person.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Sam\">Sam</a></b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: A blacksmith, eh?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Wife</b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: <a href=\"#/wiki/Sherry%20McRonald\">Sherry</a> is my wife.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Bye</b><br/>\nDonald McRonald: Yes, bye!\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Donald McRonald</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["between-the-lines-quest","blood-brothers-quest","hot-cuisine-quest"],"pos":{"x":32391,"y":32229,"z":7}}